---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Why Relaflow"
  description="Good relationships can get lost in bad systems. Relaflow brings that work into a clearer system."
>
  <PageHero eyebrow="About" title="Good relationships can get lost in bad systems." />

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-content px-6 py-16 md:px-10 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/80">
      <p>
        As organizations grow, valuable relationship information often ends up scattered across
        spreadsheets, inboxes, different platforms and individual people's knowledge.
      </p>
      <p>
        That makes it harder to know who to follow up with, where opportunities are, what is happening
        across relationships and what needs attention next.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white">Relaflow brings that work into a clearer system.</p>
      <p>
        We help organizations organize their relationship data, build practical CRM and workflow systems,
        identify opportunities and create better ways to manage the relationships that matter.
      </p>
      <p class="text-white">The goal is simple.</p>
      <p class="font-display text-2xl text-white">
        Make relationships easier to manage, opportunities easier to see and growth easier to sustain.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12">
      <a href="/contact" class="rounded bg-teal px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-navy transition-colors hover:bg-teal-deep hover:text-white">
        Work With Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
